{"title":"올 마스터 네크로맨서","thumbnail":"https://dn-img-page.kakao.com/download/resource?kid=nt0Aa/hAKLJcQi7D/6xvUIkINMepAmlkKfPDrW1&filename=th3","synopsis":"탑.\n세상이 격변을 맞이하고 나타난 미지의 곳. \n그곳에서 600층 도전을 함께한 이들에게 배신당해 쓸쓸하게 죽었다.\n\n그로부터 10년.\n지구, 그중에서도 고향인 한국에서 청년의 몸으로 환생했다.\n\n“내 뒤통수 친 놈. 그 위에 있는 놈. 모조리 씹어 먹어주마.”\n\n네크로맨서로서 정점에 오르고, 그보다 한 단계 위의 직업인 스피릿 마스터로서도 정점에 오른 존재.\n\n[차진혁]\n\n그가 올 마스터의 이름을 달고 다시금 네크로맨서(스피릿 마스터)로서 복수를 위해 탑을 오른다.","topComments":[],"commentKeywords":[],"rankSeries":{"daily":[{"date":"2026-08-09","rank":167,"change":{"type":"down","amount":3}},{"date":"2026-08-10","rank":154,"change":{"type":"up","amount":13}},{"date":"2026-08-11","rank":163,"change":{"type":"down","amount":9}},{"date":"2026-08-12","rank":171,"change":{"type":"down","amount":8}},{"date":"2026-08-13","rank":157,"change":{"type":"up","amount":14}},{"date":"2026-08-14","rank":140,"change":{"type":"up","amount":17}},{"date":"2026-08-15","rank":160,"change":{"type":"down","amount":20}},{"date":"2026-08-16","rank":149,"change":{"type":"up","amount":11}},{"date":"2026-08-17","rank":145,"change":{"type":"up","amount":4}},{"date":"2026-08-18","rank":135,"change":{"type":"up","amount":10}},{"date":"2026-08-19","rank":158,"change":{"type":"down","amount":23}},{"date":"2026-08-20","rank":124,"change":{"type":"up","amount":34}},{"date":"2026-08-21","rank":119,"change":{"type":"up","amount":5}},{"date":"2026-08-22","rank":120,"change":{"type":"down","amount":1}},{"date":"2026-08-23","rank":142,"change":{"type":"down","amount":22}},{"date":"2026-08-24","rank":142,"change":{"type":"same","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-08-25","rank":162,"change":{"type":"down","amount":20}},{"date":"2026-08-26","rank":186,"change":{"type":"down","amount":24}},{"date":"2026-08-27","rank":152,"change":null},{"date":"2026-08-28","rank":163,"change":{"type":"down","amount":11}},{"date":"2026-08-29","rank":153,"change":{"type":"up","amount":10}},{"date":"2026-08-30","rank":156,"change":{"type":"down","amount":3}},{"date":"202